==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*kleh₂-}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*klasti}}; compare {{cog|cu|класти}} (first-person singular {{m|cu|кладѫ}}), {{cog|uk|класти}}, {{cog|be|класці}}, {{cog|sh|кла̏сти}} (first singular {{m|sh|кла́де̄м}}), {{cog|sl|klásti}} (first singular {{m|sl|kládem}}), {{cog|cs|klást}} (first singular {{m|cs|kladu}}), {{cog|sk|klаsť}}, {{cog|pl|kłaść}} (first singular {{m|pl|kładę}}). More distantly cognate with {{cog|lt|klóti||to [[lay]], to [[cover]]}} (first singular {{m|lt|klóju}}), {{cog|lv|klāt||to [[cover]]}} (first singular {{m|lv|klāju}}), {{cog|got|*𐌷𐌻𐌰𐌸𐌰𐌽||to [[load]]}}, {{cog|en|lade}}, {{cog|goh|hladan||to [[load]]}}, {{cog|de|laden||to [[load]]}}. Not cognate with {{noncog|en|load}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-класть.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|класть|impf|pf=положи́ть<qq:suppletive>,сложи́ть<qq:suppletive>,накла́сть}}

# to [[put]], to [[lay]], to [[lay]] down, to [[deposit]]
#: {{pf|ru|положи́ть|сложи́ть}}
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=1877|author=w:ru:Лев Толстой<t:{{w|Leo Tolstoy}}>|title=w:ru:Анна Каренина|chapter=s:ru:[[Анна Каренина (Толстой)/Часть VI/Глава XXVIII|Часть VI. Глава XXVIII]]|location=|publisher=|newversion=English translation from|translator2=w:en:Constance Garnett|title2=s:[[Anna Karenina (Garnett)/Part Six/Chapter 28|Anna Karenina]]|location2=|publisher2=|year2=1901|page2=|pageurl2=|text=Лёвин подошёл, но, соверше́нно забы́в, в чём де́ло, и смути́вшись, обрати́лся к Серге́ю Ива́новичу с вопро́сом: «Куда́ '''класть'''?»|t=Levin advanced, but utterly forgetting what he was to do, and much embarrassed, he turned to Sergey Ivanovitch with the question, "Where am I '''to put''' it?"}}
# to [[apply]]
#: {{pf|ru|положи́ть}}
# to [[spend]]
#: {{pf|ru|положи́ть}}
# to [[erect]]
#: {{pf|ru|сложи́ть}}

====Usage notes====
* The imperfective form "ложи́ть" (''without any prefixes and reflexive suffixes'') is considered non-standard.

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf|7b+p|класть|клад}}
{{ru-conj|impf|7b+p|класть|клад|old=1}}

====Derived terms====
